     "about": "Page-entry guard for Create: creating an equipment definition needs FULL access to EQR_EQUIPMENT_MASTER, not just the READ_ONLY that lets someone browse the list. (The generic enforcePageAccessChain accepts READ_ONLY.) Before 2026-10-05 this page had no guard at all, so a read-only user -- or anyone with the URL -- could open it. The master page also hides its Create action below FULL; this closes the direct-URL path. Access not loaded yet -> let the page open, as every guard here does (canEnterPage): the map resolves moments after app start, and blocking on it would bounce real users. Save…",
